crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0533c6135bcffb6a3a6a884242f10635, https://si.imgix.net/5bc12e87/uploads/origins/9c342e0e-da3c-43a3-a81a-bdab385bff77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6890092bab744b660e3ef0d5ca1cb0a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5bc12e87/uploads/origins/9c342e0e-da3c-43a3-a81a-bdab385bff77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c79123dca8607821541d79505c998a04 3x"}, "body": "Hello, it's me again. \nI enjoyed your previous drawing.\nWould you please draw me and my friend in cute dresses, matching our colors?\nThe preferred ratio is 16:9.\n\nHere is my friend Khiren's reference: \nhttps://twitter.com/_Khiren/status/1489263227460456456\nShe is a cute and happy red panda girl who loves apples\n\nPlease use this dress for my friend Khiren: \nhttps://i.imgur.com/83qt7aZ.png\n\nPlease match it to her color palette. \nShe has deep red hair. \nHer hair ribbon would be cute if it had an apple motif. \nThe off-shoulder sweater top can match the green in her palette. \nThe ribbons on the arms can be black. \nThe skirt can remain black. \nI would love for you to include her animal ears and tail. \nShe has a stripe thing in her hair. \n\nHere is my reference: https://i.imgur.com/TK123ze.jpg\nPlease use the same outfit for me if possible. \nThe sweater top can be white. Fingerless gloves.\nThe arm ribbons can be a bronze/gold color with a blue gem in the middle of them. \nThe skirt can be a dark blue or a gradient to match my oceanic skirt. \nI don't have a tail but please include my bunny ears. \nThe hair ribbon can be bronze colored with a dogwood flower motif. \n\nPersonality is more reserved and slight smiling. \n\nThe outfits should look roughly like this: https://imgur.com/a/KSkF0tN\nI apologize for the bad drawing\n\nThe pose and scenery can be up to you. \nIf you don't wish to use the casual outfit, you can alter as you see fit.\nYou can also just draw us in our regular outfits. \n\n\nI would love to use it on SNS (Youtube, Twitter) \nKhiren uses the art tag #Khillustration on Twitter.\nI use the art tag #heartdepths.\n\nLayer separation is good but not required.\nI may alter the colors slightly with photo filter\nI like style 3\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/KSkF0tN", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@zzz_time/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1986186, "client_id": 1582369, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c897b54d0d1c732b6e4621fe7b229dba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c897b54d0d1c732b6e4621fe7b229dba, https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dff22d37473589ac5b10426641ec6822 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8702b63218dfe4c178c80ba84faae7c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d7f86bde2226eba68fb6044a57f9648", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb-e3d5684e19c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d7f86bde2226eba68fb6044a57f9648, https://si.imgix.net/2f3a1a15/uploads/origins/622d54f4-ae9b-47b3-80fb